         &nbsp;<br>526&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>FPUS53&nbsp;KMQT&nbsp;131813&nbsp;<br>ZFPMQT&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>Zone&nbsp;Forecast&nbsp;Product&nbsp;for&nbsp;western&nbsp;and&nbsp;central&nbsp;Upper&nbsp;Michigan&nbsp;<br>National&nbsp;Weather&nbsp;Service&nbsp;MARQUETTE&nbsp;MI&nbsp;<br>212&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>MIZ009-140800-&nbsp;<br>Gogebic-&nbsp;<br>Including&nbsp;the&nbsp;city&nbsp;of&nbsp;Ironwood&nbsp;<br>112&nbsp;PM&nbsp;CDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>.LATE&nbsp;THIS&nbsp;AFTERNOON...Cloudy.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;winds.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TONIGHT...Cloudy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;slight&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;<br>evening.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;west&nbsp;winds,&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;<br>northwest&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;20&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY...Cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;52.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;<br>10&nbsp;mph,&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;light&nbsp;north&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;evening,&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;<br>partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;32.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;east&nbsp;winds,&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;<br>southeast&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY...Rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;likely&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;Cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;<br>around&nbsp;55.&nbsp;South&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;60&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Breezy.&nbsp;Rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;29&nbsp;inland&nbsp;to&nbsp;<br>around&nbsp;35&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;shore.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;10&nbsp;to&nbsp;20&nbsp;mph&nbsp;inland,&nbsp;<br>except&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;20&nbsp;to&nbsp;30&nbsp;mph&nbsp;near&nbsp;the&nbsp;shore.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;<br>100&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY...Breezy.&nbsp;Rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;likely&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;morning.&nbsp;Mostly&nbsp;<br>cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;48.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;70&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY&nbsp;NIGHT&nbsp;AND&nbsp;SATURDAY...Warmer,&nbsp;clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;25&nbsp;inland&nbsp;<br>to&nbsp;around&nbsp;33&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;shore.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;58.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;33&nbsp;inland&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;39&nbsp;at&nbsp;<br>the&nbsp;shore.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;64.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;37.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;63.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;32&nbsp;inland&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;39&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;<br>shore.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TUESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;66.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>$$&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>MIZ002-140800-&nbsp;<br>Ontonagon-&nbsp;<br>Including&nbsp;the&nbsp;city&nbsp;of&nbsp;Ontonagon&nbsp;<br>212&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>.LATE&nbsp;THIS&nbsp;AFTERNOON...Cloudy.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TONIGHT...Cloudy.&nbsp;Near&nbsp;steady&nbsp;temperature&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;<br>west&nbsp;winds,&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY...Cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;53.&nbsp;Inland,&nbsp;light&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;<br>winds,&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;north&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;Near&nbsp;the&nbsp;shore,&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;<br>winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;15&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;33&nbsp;inland&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;<br>40&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;shore.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;north&nbsp;winds,&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;southeast&nbsp;after&nbsp;<br>midnight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY...Rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;likely&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;Cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;<br>around&nbsp;57.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;south&nbsp;winds.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;60&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Breezy.&nbsp;Rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;31&nbsp;inland&nbsp;to&nbsp;<br>around&nbsp;39&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;shore.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;10&nbsp;to&nbsp;20&nbsp;mph&nbsp;inland,&nbsp;<br>except&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;25&nbsp;to&nbsp;35&nbsp;mph&nbsp;near&nbsp;the&nbsp;shore.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;<br>90&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY...Breezy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;morning.&nbsp;Mostly&nbsp;<br>cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;48&nbsp;to&nbsp;53.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;50&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY&nbsp;NIGHT&nbsp;AND&nbsp;SATURDAY...Clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;26&nbsp;inland&nbsp;to&nbsp;<br>around&nbsp;37&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;shore.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;59.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;35&nbsp;inland&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;43&nbsp;at&nbsp;<br>the&nbsp;shore.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;66.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;39&nbsp;inland&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;<br>47&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;shore.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY&nbsp;AND&nbsp;MONDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Clear.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;65&nbsp;inland&nbsp;to&nbsp;<br>around&nbsp;58&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;shore.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;33&nbsp;inland&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;42&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;<br>shore.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TUESDAY...Unseasonably&nbsp;warm.&nbsp;Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;66&nbsp;to&nbsp;71.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>$$&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>MIZ084-140800-&nbsp;<br>Southern&nbsp;Houghton-&nbsp;<br>Including&nbsp;the&nbsp;cities&nbsp;of&nbsp;Kenton&nbsp;and&nbsp;Sidnaw&nbsp;<br>212&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>.LATE&nbsp;THIS&nbsp;AFTERNOON...Cloudy.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;winds.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TONIGHT...Cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;west&nbsp;winds,&nbsp;<br>becoming&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY...Cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;53.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;winds.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;31.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;north&nbsp;<br>winds,&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;southeast&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY...Rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;likely&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;Cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;<br>around&nbsp;57.&nbsp;Temperature&nbsp;falling&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;50s&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;<br>afternoon.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;south&nbsp;winds.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;60&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;29.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;<br>5&nbsp;to&nbsp;15&nbsp;mph&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;35&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;90&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY...Rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;likely&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;morning.&nbsp;Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;<br>Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;49.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;70&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY&nbsp;NIGHT&nbsp;AND&nbsp;SATURDAY...Warmer,&nbsp;clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;24.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;<br>around&nbsp;59.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;32.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;66.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;37.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;65.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;31.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TUESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;68.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>$$&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>MIZ003-140800-&nbsp;<br>Northern&nbsp;Houghton-&nbsp;<br>Including&nbsp;the&nbsp;cities&nbsp;of&nbsp;Houghton&nbsp;and&nbsp;Hancock&nbsp;<br>212&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>.LATE&nbsp;THIS&nbsp;AFTERNOON...Cloudy.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TONIGHT...Cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;West&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph,&nbsp;<br>becoming&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;20&nbsp;mph&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;51.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;<br>10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;33&nbsp;to&nbsp;38.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;east&nbsp;<br>winds,&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;southeast&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY...Rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;likely&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;Cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;<br>around&nbsp;54.&nbsp;South&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;60&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Windy.&nbsp;Rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;32&nbsp;to&nbsp;37.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;<br>winds&nbsp;15&nbsp;to&nbsp;25&nbsp;mph&nbsp;inland,&nbsp;except&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;25&nbsp;to&nbsp;35&nbsp;mph&nbsp;near&nbsp;the&nbsp;<br>shore.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;90&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY...Windy.&nbsp;A&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;morning.&nbsp;Mostly&nbsp;<br>cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;49.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;50&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;29&nbsp;inland&nbsp;